    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INFITE</strong> is a Strstegic Action game that pushes you into the fight with a third person perspective, explosive action, and strategic choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An elevated game map with verticality options and lots of personalization using a card system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful and diversified heroes design.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a bunch of well designed free heroes... with unique Abilities and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combined with different cards from our card system, each new game  will give you a new gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive action with strategic choice. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While enjoying INFITE action... making deep strategic decisions  and choosing the right cards will allow you to change your gameplay... Thus you can turn a lose situation at any moment to your favor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INFITE</strong> is a Strstegic Action game that pushes you into the fight with a third person perspective, explosive action, and strategic choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An elevated game map with verticality options and lots of personalization using a card system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful and diversified heroes design.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a bunch of well designed free heroes... with unique Abilities and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combined with different cards from our card system, each new game  will give you a new gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive action with strategic choice. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While enjoying INFITE action... making deep strategic decisions  and choosing the right cards will allow you to change your gameplay... Thus you can turn a lose situation at any moment to your favor.</p>",
